1. Scope and definitions

The "Licensor" is Elias Etl. The "Software" is the first-party Agentic UI
source code, compiled code, styles, types, and documentation distributed with
this license. Third-party code, dependencies, fonts, and other third-party
materials are excluded and retain their own licenses and notices.

"Personal Noncommercial Use" means use by a natural person, on that person's
own behalf, for personal purposes, without commercial advantage or monetary
compensation. Use for an employer, client, business, or other organization
does not qualify, even when performed by an individual, without payment, or
for an organization described as nonprofit.

"Commercial Use" includes paid client projects; consulting or other paid
work; internal business applications or operations; and products or services
that incorporate or rely on the Software for commercial purposes. Charging
for a surrounding product or service instead of charging for the Software
does not avoid this boundary. Selling copies or offering paid access to the
Software is also Commercial Use. There is no revenue threshold or automatic
exemption based on size, legal form, or nonprofit status.

