Subject to this license, the Licensor grants individuals a nonexclusive,
worldwide permission, without charge, to use, run, and reproduce the Software
for Personal Noncommercial Use. This permission continues while its conditions
are met, subject to section 6.

Commercial Use requires prior written authorization from Elias Etl. Any use
outside the personal permission, including organizational use, also requires
prior written authorization. Prices, payment, support, and additional or
commercial rights, if any, are determined only by a separate written agreement
with Elias Etl. This license promises no commercial agreement or support.

For initial contact, open an issue at https://github.com/etleli/agentic-ui/issues
requesting contact with Elias Etl. Do not post confidential business information.
Opening an issue, silence, or an informal discussion is not written authorization.

