6. Termination and proposed cure

The permissions granted by this license terminate automatically upon a
material breach. You must stop the activities for which permission has ended.
For a first breach, permissions are automatically reinstated if you fully
cure the breach within 30 calendar days after you discover it or receive
notice of it, whichever occurs first. Otherwise, or for a repeated breach,
reinstatement requires written authorization from Elias Etl. Reinstatement
does not erase liability for earlier unauthorized acts.

Termination of your permissions does not terminate the separate permissions
of recipients who comply with this license. Sections concerning ownership,
third-party rights, warranty, liability, and the effects of termination survive.

